        "text_rDzkTQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Universal Soft Breast Pump Flange Inserts are made from flexible silicone and are designed to fit inside Ameda’s standard 24mm flanges. Available in a wide range of sizes—from 11mm to 21mm—these inserts provide moms with a customized fit to ensure a more comfortable and efficient pumping session.</p>",
