        "heading_PdCE3X": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ameda GLO Flange",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_V4fgDC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Designed exclusively for use with the Ameda GLO Wearable Breast Pump, the GLO Flange provides a soft, secure fit to support better comfort and milk flow. Made from flexible, BPA-free materials, these replacement flanges are available in multiple sizes to help users achieve an effective seal and avoid discomfort during pumping. A well-fitting flange is key to optimal suction and milk expression, and the GLO Flange gives pumping parents the option to personalize their setup for a more efficient and comfortable experience. Whether you’re replacing a worn part or adjusting your fit, the GLO Flange helps keep your pumping routine smooth and reliable.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
