    "multi_column_aw7EBy": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "column_QwQ7PT": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/clean.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Clean Before First Use",
            "text": "<p>Before using any of Ameda’s breast pump flanges, always wash them with warm, soapy water and rinse them well in clean water. You can either hand-wash or place them on the top rack of a dishwasher (following product guidelines). Boiling parts for is also an option for sterilization before first use.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_pLekhX": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/position.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Check the Fit Regularly",
            "text": "<p>Your breast flange size can change as your body adjusts post-pregnancy or if your milk supply fluctuates. Regularly reassess your flange fit to ensure comfort and efficient milk flow. Check that the flange fits directly around your nipple, with minimal areola drawn into the tunnel. If discomfort occurs, or suction weakens, a size adjustment may be needed.<br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_7JtdpW": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cycle.jpg",
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Try Different Options",
            "text": "<p>If your current flange option isn’t providing the comfort or performance you need, consider exploring other styles or fits. Each option offers unique benefits, from flexible sizing to a more secure seal, helping you achieve better milk flow and comfort throughout your pumping journey.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
