          }
        },
        "text_KVerg6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Achieving pumping efficiency starts with selecting the right flange size. A properly fitted flange ensures the tunnel aligns with your nipple and creates a strong vacuum seal without causing discomfort. </p><p>When your flange fits correctly, you can express more milk in less time, helping reduce the risk of nipple pain or friction. For most moms, a well-fitting flange can shorten pumping sessions and make it easier to keep up with your baby’s needs.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
